    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhacōtes</span></b> , ae, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhacōtis</span></b> ,
		is, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an ancient name of the site of Alexandria in
				Egypt</i>, form Rhacotes, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 10,
				11, § 62</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">form Rhacotis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 84</span></i>
			.</div>
